    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif he þæt gelæste, þonne bið he weorðe þæt hine man þe bet healde, wunige þær he wunige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he carries out this vow, he shall be entitled to be treated with greater consideration, wherever he may dwell.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
